            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="REVIEW OBJECTIVE/QUESTION" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">The purpose of this systematic review is to identify, appraise and synthesize the best available qualitative evidence on the lived experiences of adults with intellectual disability who identify as lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer or questioning, intersex or asexual in mainstream society.</AbstractText>
